/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":21237,"digest":"sha256:aea4cbe8a6897ed42524b6dc7a664c0ec78d484d5bce9e174d9b2b99ad8aabc2","download_count":561,"created_at":"2026-10-19T13:23:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:23:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/releases/download/v1.25.0/packslip.sigstore.json"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington/releases/assets/656345656","id":656345656,"node_id":"RA_kwDOT-nLJc4nHwo4","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":705,"digest":"sha256:bc2f2176f49a3d53b25569e70e6649da4010b508c4f0b31c2fd19f108cc3614a","download_count":16,"created_at":"2026-10-19T13:23:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:23:02Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/releases/download/v1.25.0/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington/tarball/v1.25.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington/zipball/v1.25.0","body":"## What's Changed\n* fix(scheduler): prevent starvation across shared container builds by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/721\n* feat(cache): add remote.trust_writes for CI systems mbx does not detect by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/724\n* ci: pin perf-runner image by tag and stop automerging it by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/725\n* fix(cli): report build.rustc-wrapper = \"mbx\" instead of failing with -Zscript by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/727\n* chore(deps): update jdx crates by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/729\n* test(seed): run the access-time seeding test on Windows volumes that track access times by @JamBalaya56562 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/730\n* fix: let cargo clean -p run when a managed target link dangles by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/732\n* chore: fix clippy findings that only appear on Windows by @JamBalaya56562 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/733\n* fix(cc): identify MSVC from preprocessor macros, not banner text by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/735\n* fix(setup): skip mise's mbx shim when the Windows cargo.exe shim forwards by @JamBalaya56562 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/736\n* test(setup): keep the Windows end-to-end tests out of the developer's profile by @JamBalaya56562 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/737\n* fix(cc): enumerate include directories on every manifest request by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/738\n* fix(mise): run the Windows tasks under mise's default cmd shell by @JamBalaya56562 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/739\n* fix(mise): replace the bootstrap binary while a previous one still runs by @JamBalaya56562 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/740\n* feat(scheduler): estimate compile memory for each build mode by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/742\n* fix(scheduler): honor an explicit memory budget that fits the local machine by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/741\n* chore(mise): move the benchmark and docs-render tasks to file tasks by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/743\n* fix(materialize): stop restored build scripts from rerunning on the next unchanged build by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/745\n* feat(scheduler): record estimate accuracy and summarize it in mbx stats by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/746\n* fix(docs): make sponsor logos visible in light mode by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/747\n* feat(scheduler): record build identity and reservations in the observation log by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/749\n* feat(scheduler): let queued builds share capacity they cannot use yet by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/748\n* fix(gc): prune incremental state after worktree removal by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/752\n* fix(gc): cap incremental state at 10% of gc.max_total_size by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/751\n* feat(scheduler): budget CPU and memory separately by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/750\n* feat(scheduler): estimate memory from a calibrated window of recent peaks by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/755\n* fix(scheduler): cap memory estimates at the previous rule until the spread is calibrated by @jbellis in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/756\n* feat: seed incremental state by @ViRb3 in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/754\n* chore: release by @jdx in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/723\n\n## New Contributors\n* @JamBalaya56562 made their first contribution in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/730\n* @ViRb3 made their first contribution in https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/pull/754\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington/compare/v1.24.1...v1.25.0","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington/releases/417273868/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5}